# Every variable declared in .env.production, with where to obtain it. The real
# values live encrypted in .env.production (decrypted only for the Netlify
# production build); never put a value in this file. Add or change one with
# `npx dotenvx set KEY value -f .env.production`, which encrypts it.

# Sentry organization slug: https://sentry.io, the first segment of your Sentry URL.
SENTRY_ORG=
# Sentry project slug: https://sentry.io > Settings > Projects > your project.
SENTRY_PROJECT=
# Sentry auth token for the source map upload: https://sentry.io > Settings > Auth Tokens
# (org token with project:releases + org:read).
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=
